    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your Command Post from waves of enemy tanks by killing all of them. Fight across multiple destructible levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Tanks</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/66be92d58dc40e697fa92e99846537ca.poster.avif?t=1754574818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/66be92d58dc40e697fa92e99846537ca.apng?t=1754574818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/deecc42dcd9d5e4d906bbd05d1ffc8aa.poster.avif?t=1754574818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/deecc42dcd9d5e4d906bbd05d1ffc8aa.apng?t=1754574818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are equipped with an auto-loader that can reload shells in one second. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base/Command Post</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/e065ffbc791104148607e2e2989b0a98.poster.avif?t=1754574818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/e065ffbc791104148607e2e2989b0a98.apng?t=1754574818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=240 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep it safe, and don't shoot it yourself. Three hits and it is destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Tanks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/23a20a96e4f38e526079fef8147cf51e.poster.avif?t=1754574818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/23a20a96e4f38e526079fef8147cf51e.apng?t=1754574818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/dc10d86a9a983e901b39ea4f1e0a1c26.poster.avif?t=1754574818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/dc10d86a9a983e901b39ea4f1e0a1c26.apng?t=1754574818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/662efc48cbceec7a1e4991077def07c7.poster.avif?t=1754574818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/662efc48cbceec7a1e4991077def07c7.apng?t=1754574818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy uses a different navigation algorithm to find the CP or you. Kill them all to beat the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also special enemies that are armored:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849740/extras/24179353395e11c9a842dea28aa95d32.poster.avif?t=1754574818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s